flowchart TB
    N1["1. neo-vm-rs: Lifecycle shows how the unit reaches observable runtime operation."]
    N2["2. Configuration: opcode, gas, syscall rules, compatibility profile"]
    N3["3. Input intake: NeoVM bytecode | initial stack | syscall host callbacks"]
    N4["4. Normalization: shape bytecode, stack, gas, and syscall responses into canonical VM context"]
    N5["5. Execution or verification: Decode canonical opcodes | Execute stack and state semantics | Expose reusable runtime APIs"]
    N6["6. Commit or output: halt/fault result | final stack | gas/accounting evidence"]
    N7["7. Consumption: neo-riscv-vm | neo-zkvm | Neo N4 execution core"]
    N8["8. Operation: opcode progress, gas, stack digest, fault reason, and syscall boundary"]
    N1 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N3 --> N4
    N4 --> N5
    N5 --> N6
    N6 --> N7
    N7 --> N8
